 Updating space group information and adding the symmetry operation list.

 Antanas Vaitkus,
 2018-06-14

The following automatic conversions were performed:

'_chemical_melting_point' value '380-381' was changed to '380.5(5)' -
the average value was taken and precision was
estimated.

'_atom_site_thermal_displace_type' tag value 'Uij' was
replaced with 'Uani' value 19 times.

Automatic conversion script
